(6167370, 910308, 105130, '<td valign="top">Stunning - reminiscent of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=100393" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">paulbtlw</a>''s ''Flying to stay still'', which I love.<br/> <br/>Edit: Came back to add that I''m an idiot. Who''s the queen of bird shots here? Ye-eaah, I''m guessing this is Wendy.</td>', 'Stunning - reminiscent of  paulbtlw''s ''Flying to stay still'', which I love. Edit: Came back to add that I''m an idiot. Who''s the queen of bird shots here? Ye-eaah, I''m guessing this is Wendy.', '2010-09-20 17:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
