(6168089, 910111, 30364, '<td valign="top">I have to believe that Servranckx would rather like this.  Me too.<br/>I don''t really know how Victor might have felt: I had to look him up.  But judging by his paintings (and assuming there aren''t <i>two</i> Servranckxx, one of whom is not Vic but is a high key sculptor) I don''t think he''d tear your photograph off the wall and scream some Flemish oath.  This is my top pick then.  <i>Vaarwel!</i></td>', 'I have to believe that Servranckx would rather like this.  Me too.I don''t really know how Victor might have felt: I had to look him up.  But judging by his paintings (and assuming there aren''t two Servranckxx, one of whom is not Vic but is a high key sculptor) I don''t think he''d tear your photograph off the wall and scream some Flemish oath.  This is my top pick then.  Vaarwel!', '2010-09-21 14:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
