(6168102, 910310, 83313, '<td valign="top">Watch your JPG compression levels when you save. I see compression artifacts around the chain and your file size of 60k supports my observation. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can and still sneak in under challenge limits.</td>', 'Watch your JPG compression levels when you save. I see compression artifacts around the chain and your file size of 60k supports my observation. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can and still sneak in under challenge limits.', '2010-09-21 14:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
