(6172142, 910178, 104809, '<td valign="top">Conflicted with this image.  Meets the challenge and well shot.  It''s not overexposed like many of the entries.  There are lots of interesting shapes and a nice textures with the smooth holder and the teabag to enjoy.  I''m not sure why the overall image doesn''t appeal to me much, even with all these plusses.  It must appeal enough, though, as you got me looking at it a long time and thinking about it.</td>', 'Conflicted with this image.  Meets the challenge and well shot.  It''s not overexposed like many of the entries.  There are lots of interesting shapes and a nice textures with the smooth holder and the teabag to enjoy.  I''m not sure why the overall image doesn''t appeal to me much, even with all these plusses.  It must appeal enough, though, as you got me looking at it a long time and thinking about it.', '2010-09-26 21:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
