(6172338, 910292, 98339, '<td valign="top">J, not that I am any expert, BUT I would have to say your border hurt you on this shot...and mind you I like borders alot...but all that white area both above and below IMO take away from the presentation of the beautiful high key grass shot you were able to achieve...I''ve been hit down more than once for my borders...so that would truly be my guess</td>', 'J, not that I am any expert, BUT I would have to say your border hurt you on this shot...and mind you I like borders alot...but all that white area both above and below IMO take away from the presentation of the beautiful high key grass shot you were able to achieve...I''ve been hit down more than once for my borders...so that would truly be my guess', '2010-09-27 01:15:34.000000', NULL, 0),
