(6172407, 910292, 53147, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed this picture. But for the general DPC voter, what it is probably lacking is the instant WOW impact. Scoring well at DPC often requires you to present an image that grabs the attention quickly. This one doesnt do that so much. Does that mean its a poor image? Not a chance. It is just lacking the instant eye candy appeal that most (not all) voters are looking for to give their higher votes. In vote I hung out on it for a bit (several times) and gave it a good score. I found it lovely (and still do).</td>', 'I really enjoyed this picture. But for the general DPC voter, what it is probably lacking is the instant WOW impact. Scoring well at DPC often requires you to present an image that grabs the attention quickly. This one doesnt do that so much. Does that mean its a poor image? Not a chance. It is just lacking the instant eye candy appeal that most (not all) voters are looking for to give their higher votes. In vote I hung out on it for a bit (several times) and gave it a good score. I found it lovely (and still do).', '2010-09-27 01:40:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6172408, 910025, 67697, '<td valign="top">I guess I don''t know anything about high key.  I thought you did a great job with capturing the details in a brighter setting.  So I gave this an 8.</td>', 'I guess I don''t know anything about high key.  I thought you did a great job with capturing the details in a brighter setting.  So I gave this an 8.', '2010-09-27 01:40:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6172410, 909493, 67697, '<td valign="top">Your dog makes the best faces.  Love her!  Is this Greta?</td>', 'Your dog makes the best faces.  Love her!  Is this Greta?', '2010-09-27 01:41:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6172412, 909437, 67697, '<td valign="top">Crazy low placement.  I gave this a 7.  Loved the color and textures you captured.</td>', 'Crazy low placement.  I gave this a 7.  Loved the color and textures you captured.', '2010-09-27 01:42:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6172413, 910007, 67697, '<td valign="top">I loved the complimentary background.  Beautiful choice of subject.</td>', 'I loved the complimentary background.  Beautiful choice of subject.', '2010-09-27 01:42:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6172416, 910285, 104809, '<td valign="top">Glad this did reasonably well.  I was one of the 9''s.  :)</td>', 'Glad this did reasonably well.  I was one of the 9''s.  :)', '2010-09-27 01:44:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6172417, 909942, 67697, '<td valign="top">Wow what a wrong score.  I gave this a 7.  I thought the subject was interesting and that you also did a good job with capturing the detail.  I guess I know nothing about high key lol.</td>', 'Wow what a wrong score.  I gave this a 7.  I thought the subject was interesting and that you also did a good job with capturing the detail.  I guess I know nothing about high key lol.', '2010-09-27 01:44:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6172424, 910305, 53147, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8 in challenge and had it high in my second rung of images for the challenge. I seem to be connecting with your work pretty consistently lately. I dont know if that would be considered a good thing or not. ;)</td>', 'I gave this an 8 in challenge and had it high in my second rung of images for the challenge. I seem to be connecting with your work pretty consistently lately. I dont know if that would be considered a good thing or not. ;)', '2010-09-27 01:51:37.000000', NULL, 0),
