(6174913, 910052, 79720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dsa157:</b></div><hr/><i> gorgeous portrait, and you captured the model really well, but I wouldn''t consider this a high key shot. too many dark tones in the background. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>...1% of which are below 50% grey. But, thanks....I do appreciate your input, and realize many probably interpret this image in the same way. Doesn''t mean you''re not wrong, because you are. <b>:</b>)))</td>', 'Originally posted by dsa157: gorgeous portrait, and you captured the model really well, but I wouldn''t consider this a high key shot. too many dark tones in the background.  ...1% of which are below 50% grey. But, thanks....I do appreciate your input, and realize many probably interpret this image in the same way. Doesn''t mean you''re not wrong, because you are. :)))', '2010-09-29 13:43:41.000000', NULL, 0),
